[{"title":"次韵奉待四叔父","author":"谢铎","text":"书传能到日，心苦未逢时。\n不语对歧路，有怀如乱丝。\n十年犹是别，百岁若为期。\n昨日南征雁，还家报已迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35026,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿德州","author":"谢铎","text":"今夜客中宿，德州城外船。\n山东馀土俗，蓟北少风烟。\n军馈交相集，舟行不可前。\n时闻羸老语，菜熟是丰年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35027,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"期筠心不至","author":"谢铎","text":"消息浑难定，先生故不来。\n眼花空对烛，心渴已生埃。\n白发天谁管，青山路有媒。\n此生真昨梦，随意且衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35028,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游灵岩谒杜清献公读书处","author":"谢铎","text":"欲飞神不住，未到眼先明。\n山岂过江好，心终背郭清。\n村名犹杜曲，相业自端平。\n再拜吾何敢，凄然愧后生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35029,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒忠文先生追次先生旧韵","author":"谢铎","text":"太息青岩老，当年此灌畦。\n渭车方入卜，周道已兴西。\n齧雪终辞汉，封茅不到齐。\n惟馀文冢在，千古说幽栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35030,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒楼桑庙","author":"谢铎","text":"仓皇衣带诏，辛苦武乡侯。\n西蜀分王地，中山奋迹秋。\n蛟龙曾失势，鱼水故相投。\n千载英雄泪，还同沛水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35031,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓泊西郭","author":"谢铎","text":"西郭舟初泊，东方日未明。\n荒村无犬吠，古寺有钟声。\n潮落夜归海，江空秋满城。\n故乡南望处，渐见白云横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35032,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"琼岛春云","author":"谢铎","text":"蓬海分明在眼中，暖云高捧玉芙蓉。\n春阴欲下清虚殿，朝彩先浮最上峰。\n瑶管声中迷去鹤，金根影里护双龙。\n夜来雨过知多少，试向东郊问老农。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35033,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄城南诸友","author":"谢铎","text":"十年回首论交地，万地閒情入望初。\n阙下每闻乡国事，灯前重简故人书。\n红尘满路看羸马，芳草经春想旧庐。\n出处祗今何处是，欲从南谷问华胥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35034,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过歌风台","author":"谢铎","text":"台下残碑手重摩，腐儒千载此经过。\n诸生未识叔孙礼，游子还从父老歌。\n日落五陵无旧树，风来泗水有馀波。\n神骓不逝空成泣，走狗犹存奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35035,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五叔父在金陵有约还家舟中奉怀","author":"谢铎","text":"去年相约及春归，春列淮南尚客衣。\n一路风光看欲遍，隔江消息报来稀。\n渡头芳草惊新梦，竹下清阴想旧扉。\n先后到家那可问，倚篷终日雁南飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35036,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜陈儒珍来过","author":"谢铎","text":"一住休言十日馀，几从门下望高车。\n殷勤岂是爱留客，寥落近来成索居。\n莞海秋风人去后，巴山夜雨梦回初。\n多情见说城南路，杨柳千行绿渐疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35037,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉十五叔父夜话有感","author":"谢铎","text":"竹边饭罢酒停斟，漫拥寒炉坐夜深。\n慷慨共谈当世事，依稀多愧古人心。\n孤怀耿耿乾坤窄，短鬓毵毵岁月侵。\n欲上南山望湖海，不知明日是晴阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35038,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次儒珍韵","author":"谢铎","text":"十年海岭经行处，往事多从梦里违。\n黑发交情今日在，红尘世路几人归。\n屋头流水有深浅，门外青山无是非。\n杨柳东风零落尽，松阴不改旧柴扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35039,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春愁","author":"谢铎","text":"独上高楼望眼开，春愁无数逐人来。\n官河二月冰初合，水国经年雁未回。\n歧路关心妨斥堠，野田生事入蒿莱。\n何须更问门前柳，深放黄金作酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35040,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起","author":"谢铎","text":"病起风光四月过，萧萧双鬓不知皤。\n惊心午饭还宜粥，入眼春衫尽换罗。\n筋力转妨骑马怯，路歧生见出门多。\n百年梦觉今如此，一笑青山奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35041,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送秦太守廷韶","author":"谢铎","text":"江湖姓字十年期，雅韵清怀众所知。\n念我故非萍水合，对君真重竹林思。\n郎官岁久犹为郡，刺史名高不在诗。\n南去邵陵应咫尺，甘泉春老有新枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35042,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曰川席上分韵得林字","author":"谢铎","text":"主情珍重十分深，洒债诗盟许重寻。\n此日开轩留客意，当年虚席待君心。\n看山未拟怀西郭，伐木如闻在远林。\n最是舞雩风日好，几时归咏听馀音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35043,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与师召过北海子因忆宾之相约不果","author":"谢铎","text":"鸟外青山宿雨过，马头西望郁嵯峨。\n烟光欲堕连云起，秋色平分隔水多。\n歧路有情方坎坷，客心无赖益蹉跎。\n归来莫怪相期晚，不出从嗔奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35044,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴元玉冬官还南都","author":"谢铎","text":"相思何夕此相逢，又报离筵郭外供。\n客路交期惊晚合，马头诗兴及春浓。\n星辰夜静劳瞻夕，江海风高忆住冬。\n安得湖州千袜绢，赠君东去写吴淞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35045,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵胡宪副廷慎彭城夜话之作","author":"谢铎","text":"长忆苏家好弟兄，夜床听雨复寒城。\n一时会合真难事，千古风流尚此情。\n碣岭北来云作阵，桓山东去石为茔。\n青樽落日无穷恨，又是阳关第几声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35046,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵宾之游海印寺","author":"谢铎","text":"海子桥边路入塍，桔槔亭外石悬藤。\n马头碧水如迎客，郭里青山亦占僧。\n问旧未须惊世改，倦游空自忆吾曾。\n天台雁宕平生兴，却怪年来总未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35047,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陵祀次李侍讲赠行韵","author":"谢铎","text":"诸陵王气与天通，唐汉分明在下风。\n辇路夜深联隧道，寝园春近接离宫。\n水声直过龙河北，山势遥临碣石东。\n圣德皇恩今亿载，岂胜凄感月明中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35048,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵杨维立编修与兄维贞侍御侍班述怀之作","author":"谢铎","text":"禁鼓初严晓促班，佩声遥在殿中间。\n雁行侧立参差地，龙衮前瞻咫尺颜。\n五色云中通御气，九重天远隔尘寰。\n官曹旧接鸣珂里，几听前呵拥马还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35049,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明谒陵次杨学士维新韵 其一","author":"谢铎","text":"四庙衣冠尚衮龙，英灵千载此攸钟。\n遗弓欲泣荆湖鼎，斩板殊深夏屋封。\n汉寝自应传百代，秦泉何必锢三重。\n白头官监劳供奉，晨鼓初停又暮钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35050,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明谒陵次杨学士维新韵 其二","author":"谢铎","text":"好景分明画不成，品题今日仆须更。\n路从险处行来稳，山到深时望却平。\n花气暖催春日转，树声寒带朔风鸣。\n向来奔走偷閒地，始觉官曹分外清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35051,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清明谒陵次杨学士维新韵 其三","author":"谢铎","text":"万马争群气欲酣，归鞭遥指路东南。\n月低浅水寒生练，露下空山夜滴岚。\n远近鸡声催晓漏，微茫人语识乡谈。\n天涯岁岁逢寒食，故国谁同扫墓庵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35052,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中次黄汝彝韵","author":"谢铎","text":"往事分明梦里真，路歧辛苦为谁频。\n雨声彻夜将辞晓，花意逢秋不及春。\n白发渐生今日恨，青山无复旧时人。\n西风莫更还多事，爱送悲歌易水滨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35053,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕小尽立春有感","author":"谢铎","text":"病来酷爱青山好，老去难争白发催。\n生怪月当除夕小，多情春与隔年来。\n荣华不驻风前蜡，消息空传陇上梅。\n四十九年真昨梦，壮心刚说未成灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35054,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再次赏菊韵一首赠四叔父","author":"谢铎","text":"几见东风换物华，平章宅里是谁家。\n自怜天与冰霜骨，不向春争富贵花。\n老去有香终不俗，栽时无地且教赊。\n独伤采掇非今日，秋满南山恨未涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35055,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瀑布","author":"谢铎","text":"李白平生不到处，巨那抵死来相看。\n龙湫下激喷晴雪，岩雨倒飞生昼寒。\n怒声奔海直欲到，清气逼人那可干。\n恶诗莫问谁堪洗，战马屯兵血未乾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35056,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雁湖再次前韵","author":"谢铎","text":"雁湖高处不胜舟，见说诸天在上头。\n定有楼台非世界，更无花木亦春秋。\n谈空谩忆三生在，飞锡终堪一到休。\n不识阆丘蓬岛外，几人曾伴赤松游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35057,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居有怀诸同年","author":"谢铎","text":"十载重来两鬓霜，直庐原是旧斋房。\n相看敢作忘言地，不寐翻思少日狂。\n灯烛影怜生死恨，路歧辛苦梦魂妨。\n觉来忽报趋朝鼓，又是披衣一日忙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35058,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒李先生墓","author":"谢铎","text":"十里惊沙郭外风，乱云回首是江东。\n半生分已天教病，一恸谁期此拜公。\n泪尽西州人共老，梦深辽海夜难终。\n祗应万古丰碑在，盛德殊恩总化工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35059,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月望日雪","author":"谢铎","text":"朝罢归来背客眠，马头春色转堪怜。\n随阳错报经年雁，剩雪犹深二月天。\n惊犬吠人疑北越，冻雷崩石忆西川。\n闭门只合频呼酒，莫问霜毛白满颠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35060,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿刘谏议祠有感诸公壁间之作","author":"谢铎","text":"漏转山城独坐迟，一灯明灭几停吹。\n斋心俨觉神如对，春梦空怜夜作期。\n五度客来须笑我，百年人在定应谁。\n壁间敢恨题名晚，浅薄终惭谏议祠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35061,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至长陵望茂陵有感","author":"谢铎","text":"北门谁筑此幽都，形胜天门绝代无。\n四塞山河归一统，万年陵寝壮雄图。\n梦惊清跸还驰道，痛忆遗弓在鼎湖。\n望断六龙新蜕地，九疑何处是苍梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35062,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"候祀诸陵","author":"谢铎","text":"寂寥风色夜凄凄，寝殿门深接御堤。\n九陛神灵天陟降，五陵灯火路东西。\n星辰影动千官合，松柏声寒万马嘶。\n奔走小臣今白发，报恩无地独含悽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35063,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得家书有感","author":"谢铎","text":"忽报寒梅陇上枝，马头风色暮春时。\n青山自信今犹昨，白发休疑我是谁。\n门祚光华诸弟在，宦途情绪病妻知。\n梦魂夜夜南飞雁，莫遣平安误作期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35064,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"约西厓游西山","author":"谢铎","text":"百年消息此尘寰，一笑纷纷几触蛮。\n身正健时须载酒，兴堪春尽也登山。\n是谁白发能容老，何处黄金得买閒。\n十载江南回首地，梦魂犹在有无间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35065,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲秋","author":"谢铎","text":"坐看明月下西楼，不断砧声万里愁。\n长夜可应谁待旦，老年今已怯悲秋。\n极知世故皆黄叶，故向人生怨白头。\n青海碧山无恙在，也须惭愧此盟鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35066,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中不及预同年会柬席上诸公","author":"谢铎","text":"三百人中今十人，回头二十七年春。\n蘧蘧枕畔梦未觉，落落天边星已晨。\n病来苦恨路歧隔，欢在且教樽酒频。\n勋名镜里各自爱，莫问谁家发似银。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35067,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋色","author":"谢铎","text":"晓露枝头半夕霏，近人秋色故依依。\n小窗得此已非俗，荒径待兹胡不归。\n晚节有情看岁月，春风何意入芳菲。\n无弦别是琴中趣，莫向东篱问白衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35068,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次吴匏庵原博过西苑韵","author":"谢铎","text":"平步分明是绝尘，十洲深处渺无津。\n漏声昼下通西掖，御气秋高薄紫宸。\n天上风光元隔别，梦中歧路几纷纶。\n极知供奉非前度，白发重来愧小臣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35069,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月廿一日留别陈太常先生","author":"谢铎","text":"去年八月二日到，未到今年八月归。\n白头自爱此身在，清世敢言吾道非。\n乡井梦随多病苦，江湖心与故交稀。\n相逢莫问莼鲈兴，不待秋风已拂衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35070,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"盆荷","author":"谢铎","text":"倚遍虚栏看小荷，晓缸分涨碧生波。\n参差出水雨声急，次第着根秋意多。\n白发偶同君子爱，画船休唱越溪歌。\n独怜玉井非吾地，十丈花高奈尔何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35071,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"愿学继休期登高以病不至","author":"谢铎","text":"咫尺登临路未通，百年能几啸歌同。\n兴犹未败催租雨，病忽先惊落帽风。\n怅望祗应惭地主，遭逢何故怨天公。\n定知不负青山约，黄菊秋深正满丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35072,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别蓬莱馆","author":"谢铎","text":"病骨经秋未觉轻，几从乡梦数归程。\n可应金马门无路，似与蓬莱馆有情。\n塞雁风高天色改，庭梧叶堕旅魂惊。\n一方留滞真堪笑，三见初弦海月生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35073,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游戒珠寺有感","author":"谢铎","text":"劫火光寒射戒珠，右军亭馆迹全芜。\n墨池春尽谁深浅，笔冢秋高半有无。\n往事谩劳千载念，浮生共是百年图。\n不知采蕺兴邦后，禾黍离离几故都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35074,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过金华诸郡有感","author":"谢铎","text":"伏枕经秋得暂还，可堪歧路转间关。\n无端更历三秋路，不厌频看两浙山。\n乡味渐知鲈鲙美，客愁难减鬓毛斑。\n圣恩旧识深如海，便合从兹谢世艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35075,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵忆戴安州","author":"谢铎","text":"两度河间有报书，安州不见驾来车。\n兴知王子殊非浅，迹在韦郎本不疏。\n未必老逾相别后，可应难是入官初。\n十年离恨长安地，尚忆趋庭有伯鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35076,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郑大尹还天台","author":"谢铎","text":"天台作县比神仙，好客仍兼郑老贤。\n桐柏宫中春载酒，石梁桥上夜忘眠。\n别来最是尘埃苦，老去还于水石偏。\n此日送君重有感，不堪归思益茫然。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35077,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨太真","author":"谢铎","text":"春老华清宴，门深羯鼓声。\n新台高百尺，不见范阳兵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35078,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题便面","author":"谢铎","text":"旧业留芳径，閒云度远岑。\n溪桥回首处，应悔出山深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35079,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景二绝句 其一","author":"谢铎","text":"招招隔岸舟，我心行且畏。\n岂不念远游，渡头风稳未。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35080,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小景二绝句 其二","author":"谢铎","text":"向月援鸣琴，悠然憩山趾。\n古调今不谐，含情付流水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35081,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题魏冢宰送张县丞诗","author":"谢铎","text":"尚书归去鬓如蓬，桃李门墙想旧容。\n不识春风行乐地，多情还到博陵松。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35082,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次儒珍韵","author":"谢铎","text":"高秋林下相逢日，犹忆天台道上诗。\n莫向樽前易离别，归来已是十年期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35083,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶为","author":"谢铎","text":"冀北近来风土别，一冬和气满郊畿。\n去年记得江南路，冻雨潇潇雪乱飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35084,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夜","author":"谢铎","text":"暗里年光此黑头，落花无计水东流。\n谁将多事分年岁，添得今宵一倍愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35085,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春旦","author":"谢铎","text":"谁家池馆爱逢新，满地笙歌遏路尘。\n几日东风在杨柳，长安门外未知春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35086,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春雪","author":"谢铎","text":"二月东风翻作冻，两年春意腊前归。\n越中儿女燕中长，不识今朝是雪飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35087,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵题便面小景","author":"谢铎","text":"空江收网雨收蓑，忽听中流欸乃歌。\n莫是晚来风色好，片帆归去已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35088,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天台道中","author":"谢铎","text":"出门一笑欲褰衣，华顶峰头半落晖。\n怪杀平生山水癖，隔溪灯火夜深归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35089,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月廿七日登缌山有感","author":"谢铎","text":"花落春归可奈何，白头清泪几滂沱。\n缌山不是西州路，敢作羊昙醉后过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35090,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿华严寺有感","author":"谢铎","text":"又作华严寺里眠，一灯无寐故依然。\n谁知五度经行客，白发相看四十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35091,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过白沟河有感","author":"谢铎","text":"山后山前十六州，坐输天险竟谁收。\n过河漫作千秋恨，狼籍曾闻在白沟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35092,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中有怀古直","author":"谢铎","text":"醉里乾坤不记年，忽闻多病亦凄然。\n可应寂寂青灯地，谁共呻吟对雨眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":35093,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]